       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EXJOIN.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LEFT-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 LEFT-STATUS PIC 99.
01 RIGHT-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 RIGHT-STATUS PIC 99.
01 JOIN-OUTPUT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 JOIN-STATUS PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LEFT-AMOUNT LEFT-STATUS
    RIGHT-AMOUNT RIGHT-STATUS JOIN-OUTPUT JOIN-STATUS.
JOIN-BRANCHES.
    MOVE ZERO TO JOIN-OUTPUT JOIN-STATUS.
    IF LEFT-STATUS NOT = ZERO
        MOVE LEFT-STATUS TO JOIN-STATUS
        MOVE ZERO TO JOIN-OUTPUT
    ELSE
        IF RIGHT-STATUS NOT = ZERO
            MOVE RIGHT-STATUS TO JOIN-STATUS
            MOVE ZERO TO JOIN-OUTPUT
        ELSE
            COMPUTE JOIN-OUTPUT = LEFT-AMOUNT + RIGHT-AMOUNT
                ON SIZE ERROR
                    MOVE 25 TO JOIN-STATUS
                    MOVE ZERO TO JOIN-OUTPUT
                NOT ON SIZE ERROR
                    MOVE ZERO TO JOIN-STATUS
            END-COMPUTE
        END-IF
    END-IF.
    GOBACK.
